cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Pilot Control: A Maritime Safety Benchmark for LLM Agents"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Tarn
    given-names: Willis
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2025-06-13
url: "https://github.com/willtarn/pilot-control"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ai-safety
  - llm-evaluation
  - maritime
  - inspect
  - colregs
  - mass
abstract: >-
  Pilot Control is a 40-case behavioural-evaluation benchmark for LLM agents
  in maritime decision-making contexts, scored on five behavioural axes
  (correctness, calibration, escalation, authority-respect, COLREGs/ROE
  rule-following) across four scenario families (maintenance deferral,
  anomaly triage, incident escalation, autonomous-surface-vessel exception
  handling). Built in UK AISI Inspect format.
